Subject: [PATCH 0019] Prism: spaces dashboard trigger on the tab strip row

Recon §7: ego's spaces trigger lives on the TAB STRIP row, pinned to the
window's top-right corner (30x30 DIP, "Open Space (⌥S)"), not on the
toolbar row. Adds PrismSpacesButton (overlay) to
HorizontalTabStripRegionView, after the grab-handle space so it stays at
the corner; click runs the same action as ⌥S / IDC_PRISM_SPACES_OVERVIEW.
The button shows a four-squares grid at 0 running agents and a dark
count circle at >0 (1s SpaceManager poll, the Dock badge's cadence).

